astric cancer: comparing it with p53 accumulation, <italic>Helicobacter pylori</italic> infection, and vascular endothelial growth factor expression</article-title><source>J Surg Oncol</source><year>2002</year><volume>80</volume><fpage>79</fpage><lpage>88</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Surg Oncol||80|79||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12173384</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kikuchi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Katada</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Sakuramoto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimao</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kakita</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohida</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Saigenji</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Efficacy of endoscopic surveillance of the upper gastrointestinal tract following distal gastrectomy for early gastric cancer</article-title><source>Hepatogastroenterology</source><year>2003</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>1704</fpage><lpage>1707</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Hepatogastroenterology||50|1704||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14571822</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>TY</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hwang</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Bang</surname><given-names>YJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kang</surname><given-names>GH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Methyl